00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.990
So, just to compare, uh, traditional

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.510
programming procedural programming

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.390
languages versus hardware description

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.790
languages,

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.470
procedural languages describe how

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.310
something is done.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.910
So, they describe, uh, a sequence of

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.190
