00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.270
And the descriptions we use in hardware

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.790
description languages can be used both

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.350
for simulation. That is for verifying

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:55.430
