00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.110
And they they're also used for

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.790
synthesis. That is for actually

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:05.230
automatically generating a description

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.070
